# Shell scripts are COPY'd into a Linux image and run with /bin/sh (see
# Dockerfile → docker-entrypoint.sh). They MUST keep LF endings even when the
# repo is checked out on Windows, where core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# rewrite them to CRLF and `/bin/sh` would fail on the trailing \r of every line.
*.sh text eol=lf
